# Kazham's Chieftainess (Zilart 3, mission.zilart.kazhams_chieftainess): Norg's Gilgamesh plays 7; Kazham's
# Jakoh Wahcondalo plays 114, whose finish completes the mission: the Sacrificial Chamber Key
# (KEYITEM_OBTAINED 6398), The Temple of Uggalepih current. Then Jakoh plays that mission's 115
# (04_The_Temple_of_Uggalepih's reply).
lists Norg/Gilgamesh/onTrigger Kazham/Jakoh_Wahcondalo/onTrigger Kazham/onEventFinish/114
char zone=Norg pos=120,-8,-12 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart KazhamsChieftainess current
login
trigger Gilgamesh                       # 7
finish
warp 103,-15,-113 Kazham
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # 114
finish                                  # completed
trigger Jakoh_Wahcondalo                # The Temple of Uggalepih current: its 115
finish-if-event
